//! Evora build (patch EVORA-CIC-22, class E9 extended): Evora's pictograms.
//!
//! The audit of the 215 upstream pictograms (CIC-FK-B2, 2026-10-27) gave 46 of them an outline
//! equivalent in Evora's own pictogram catalogue, the set Evora's views draw (outline paths on a
//! 24-unit grid, stroke only; Heroicons, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2020 Refactoring UI Inc., see
//! NOTICE). Those 46 are drawn here, in place of the upstream drawings: `icons::paint` hands every
//! name to [`paint`] first. Six are composed in the same grammar from the catalogue's strokes (the
//! information sign, the menu bars, three paragraph alignments, the no-colour sign); one is a
//! catalogue path mirrored (rotate clockwise). The other 169 pictograms are left to Evora's
//! clean-room team.
//!
//! The table is written by Evora's tool (`c1_pictos.py` of the lot): each path is flattened to
//! polylines (curves and arcs sampled every 0.75 unit at most), a subpath of one point is a dot.
//! Each entry names its source. Do not edit it by hand.

